<body>
    <h1>Library Management System Project Overview</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 local-id=3D"6ccd07b7e4fd" id=3D"LibraryManagementSystemProjectO=
verview-LibraryManagementSystemProjectOverview">Library Management System P=
roject Overview</h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"a28ee1fca4d4" id=3D"LibraryManagementSystemProjectOverview-=
ProjectDescription">Project Description</h2>
<p local-id=3D"15bb5f390d99">The Library Management System is designed to m=
anage library activities such as searching books, user registration, book r=
eservations, borrowing, and returning books.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"c6a4cbc796b0" id=3D"LibraryManagementSystemProjectOverview-=
ProjectObjectives">Project Objectives</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"05a4f64c-1735-4f72-ac2e-0a983de3f194">
<li local-id=3D"fde0495a-a50e-4b87-b602-709fca40b3d3">
<p local-id=3D"319c25e6349c">Develop a simple and user-friendly library man=
agement system.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"611be85e-0f9c-46f3-90c2-fe486d92f28f">
<p local-id=3D"b6ca0bc756d4">Allow users to search books by title and autho=
r.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"118558bd-2fc6-460c-a800-9e31cdbca966">
<p local-id=3D"5b1dec7ba24d">Implement user registration and login function=
ality.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"83da9eff-2f25-4685-9a6a-13e419637a91">
<p local-id=3D"bc8146e7aa9f">Manage book borrowing and reservations.</p>
</li>
<li local-id=3D"445e0fb7-147a-4e9e-b1f0-4f45445a6099">
<p local-id=3D"b54fcc803fd8">Monitor project tasks and development progress=
 using Jira.</p>
</li>
</ul>
