<h2 local-id=3D"653372b94ce5" id=3D"LibraryManagementSystemProjectOverview-=
Conclusion">Conclusion</h2>
<p local-id=3D"9831d083492e">The Library Management System helps manage lib=
rary activities such as book searching, user login, reservations, borrowing=
, and returning books.</p>
<p local-id=3D"c726f2e0d9c7">Jira is used to create, prioritize, and track =
project tasks.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a71ccf3465cc">Confluence provides a centralized platform to =
display Jira tasks and monitor project progress.</p>
<p local-id=3D"edfd19626387">The progress indicator helps identify complete=
d, ongoing, and pending tasks.</p>
<p local-id=3D"f7006a931dd4">The integration of Jira and Confluence improve=
s project management, task tracking, and documentation.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"ae4c03c5a4dc" id=3D"LibraryManagementSystemProjectOverview-=
ProjectManagement">Project Management</h2>
<p local-id=3D"349dfe5f75b3">Jira is used to create, prioritize, and track =
project tasks.</p>
<p local-id=3D"b5da32298534">Confluence is used to document the project ove=
rview, display Jira tasks, and monitor project progress.</p>
<p local-id=3D"be2fb2702920"></p>
    </div>
